OL,3,AChris Mason: Home secretary to face
OL,4,Ascrutiny over changes to rules for
OL,5,Alegal migrants
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt the heart of the debate around legal
OL,8,Fmigration are contested notions of
OL,9,Ffairness.
OL,11,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood has
OL,12,Ftalked of her parents coming to the UK
OL,13,Ffrom rural Kashmir. Now, this daughter
OL,14,Fof immigrants is responsible for
OL,15,Freshaping the very system that brought
OL,16,Fthem here decades ago ` and doing so in
OL,17,Fa way that both her party and the
OL,18,Fcountry regard as fair.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
